Error [jet.CompileTimeIfNotConstant]: This `#if` condition can't be known at compile time
  --> tests/ui/comptime_if_noncomptime_cond.jet:3:9
    |
  3 |     #if x {
    |         ^
 Why: A `#if` condition must be a known-time expression — a prepared value, a literal, or a pure function call with known arguments
 Fix: Prepare the value first: `flag: #run { … }`, then write `#if flag { … }`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0989
